      "text": "God created man in his own image, Gen. 1:27 (Moses 2:27). God created man, in the likeness of God made he him, Gen. 5:1. in the image of God made he man, Gen. 9:6. Lord went his way, as soon as he had left communing, Gen. 18:33. I have seen God face to face, Gen. 32:30. they saw the God of Israel: and there was under his feet, Ex. 24:10. written with the finger of God, Ex. 31:18 (Deut. 9:10). Lord spake unto Moses face to face, Ex. 33:11. thou shalt see my back parts: but my face shall not be seen, Ex. 33:23. With him will I speak mouth to mouth, Num. 12:8.",
